"`Pixracer Pro <https://store.mrobotics.io>`__ 是 mRo Pixracer 系列的下一代飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixracer-pro.rst:19
#: 3c0fdf977b2049218733a74ceafde25b
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixracer-pro.rst:21
#: 326071ecf77549fbb620a08b12120b1f
msgid ""
"The `Pixracer Pro <https://store.mrobotics.io>`__ is the next generation of "
"mRobotics' family of Pixracer autopilots. It has been designed primarily for"
" the demanding requirements of small multicopters, but of course can be used"
" on planes and other vehicles which require no more than 8 pwm outputs for "
"controlling escs and motors."
msgstr ""
"`Pixracer Pro <https://store.mrobotics.io>`__ 是 mRobotics Pixracer "
"飞控系列的下一代产品。它主要为小型多旋翼的严苛需求而设计，当然也可用于只需不超过 8 路 PWM 输出来控制 ESC 和电机的飞机和其他飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pixracer-pro.rst:26
#: 9d056c4eeb364187bced0a70cb9687a8
msgid ""
"At time of writing the autopilot is still being evolved/improved. The final "
"version may very slightly from the information provided here."
msgstr "撰写本文时，该飞控仍在持续发展/改进中。最终版本可能与此处提供的信息略有不同。"

